{"text": "On a windy Saturday, Mia and her grandpa took a red kite to the top of the hill. Grandpa ran fast, and the kite flew high above the trees. Suddenly, the string broke, and the kite flew away over the town! Mia was very sad, but Grandpa smiled and said, 'Don't worry. Let's find it.' They found the kite in a tall tree in the park, and a kind man with a long ladder helped them get it down. In the evening, they flew the red kite again, and this time Mia held the string very tightly.", "words": [[0.48, 0.58], [0.62, 0.64], [0.78, 1.08], [1.24, 1.74], [2.28, 2.48], [2.64, 2.74], [2.78, 2.86], [2.92, 3.4], [3.68, 3.84], [3.88, 3.9], [4.0, 4.22], [4.34, 4.7], [4.98, 5.06], [5.1, 5.18], [5.26, 5.46], [5.52, 5.6], [5.66, 5.74], [5.82, 6.1], [7.68, 8.14], [8.32, 8.54], [8.72, 9.22], [9.62, 9.7], [9.72, 9.78], [9.84, 10.14], [10.18, 10.38], [10.52, 10.78], [10.86, 11.1], [11.14, 11.22], [11.3, 11.84], [13.38, 13.8], [14.06, 14.14], [14.24, 14.6], [14.72, 15.12], [15.58, 15.64], [15.66, 15.74], [15.78, 16.08], [16.16, 16.36], [16.42, 16.74], [16.9, 17.06], [17.1, 17.18], [17.26, 17.7], [19.26, 19.42], [19.54, 19.68], [19.74, 19.96], [20.14, 20.56], [20.86, 20.98], [21.02, 21.44], [21.62, 22.08], [22.12, 22.24], [22.32, 22.58], [22.94, 23.2], [23.28, 23.58], [24.02, 24.22], [24.3, 24.62], [24.7, 25.0], [26.36, 26.46], [26.54, 26.8], [26.82, 26.9], [26.96, 27.34], [27.6, 27.68], [27.72, 27.74], [27.86, 28.14], [28.26, 28.56], [28.64, 28.7], [28.74, 28.82], [28.86, 29.28], [29.82, 29.9], [29.94, 29.96], [30.04, 30.42], [30.5, 30.8], [31.12, 31.24], [31.26, 31.28], [31.38, 31.64], [31.74, 32.04], [32.28, 32.54], [32.56, 32.68], [32.74, 32.88], [32.92, 33.0], [33.08, 33.5], [35.06, 35.12], [35.16, 35.24], [35.38, 35.78], [36.22, 36.32], [36.4, 36.6], [36.64, 36.72], [36.82, 37.0], [37.08, 37.4], [37.42, 37.72], [38.24, 38.34], [38.38, 38.54], [38.62, 38.98], [39.08, 39.26], [39.36, 39.56], [39.62, 39.7], [39.8, 40.16], [40.34, 40.58], [40.68, 42.3]], "scenes": [0.0, 7.23, 12